just what tricks do the batman director  matt reeves and his crew have up their  sleeves for audiences could the riddle  be on us keep watching for one big twist  the movie has in store batman has his  hands full in the newest entry to the  dark knight movie mythos this time  around the riddler is a serial killer  targeting gotham's elite to bring their  corruption to light catwoman seems like  she may be an ally but as tends to be  the case throughout her history with the  bat she causes her own share of  headaches and the penguin rubs elbows  with the most dangerous criminals in all  of gotham through his nightclub batman's  arguably the busiest person in gotham  and that's just the beginning of his  problems however people with fun  nicknames who sometimes wear costumes  are only part of the equation there are  plenty of criminals who keep a lower  profile and that's where carmine falcone  enters the picture he's a crime lord  who's awfully chummy with penguin and  has a history of keeping the most  powerful people in the city under his  thumb he's a menacing force that lurks  in the shadows and while he may not be  as flashy he's just as if not more  terrifying given his proclivity for  criminal activity it makes one of the  movie's primary twists all the more  shocking in the batman riddler sets out  to reveal a massive conspiracy in which  gotham's elite power brokers took funds  from the wayne foundation's renewal  project the project had dedicated one  billion dollars per year to help  gothamites but the conspiracists line  their own pockets instead but there's a  rat in their midst then the riddler  wants this individual to come to light  to pay for their actions batman and  police lieutenant james gordon attempt  to find this rat knowing he'll be the  next riddler victim they have several  guesses initially with the only clue  being the spanish phrase rata alada  which roughly translates to winged rat  at first batman assumes the rap must be  the penguin since penguins have wings  when that turns out to be a dead end he  wonders if he's at the center of this  conspiracy somehow since bats are  sometimes derogatorily called rats with  wings but that's when he has a  realization that falcone has falcon  right there in the name and falcons have  wings  it all adds up to a sinister  riddle riddler  riddler  it's a development that likely took  plenty of fans by surprise in the comics  falcone is a ruthless mob boss known as  the roman in honor of his ruthless  demeanor he keeps more to the shadows in  the batman and his turn as the rat is a  significant departure from his  depictions in the comics tv shows and  other movies no doubt it took plenty of  audience members by surprise just one of  the many shocking moments to be found in  the batman carmine falcone doesn't get a  ton of screen time into batman but he  makes excellent use of the scenes he  does appear in it goes along perfectly  with his attitude he can be a more  effective crime lord if he keeps a low  profile and stays out of the public eye  as often as possible however it's clear  he gets into ample trouble behind the  scenes as it turns out he's not just a  rat but also the father of a cat he's  selena kyle aka catwoman's dad granted  some fans were probably more likely to  see this particular twist coming seeing  how there's precedent for it in the  comic books their relationship is hinted  at in the long halloween in its sequel  in the movie catwoman knows for sure  that falcone is her father but he's  completely unaware of her existence he  only learns the truth when she reveals  herself to him and mentions her mother  maria kyle to his face selena kyle may  be okay with letting palconee live in  the comics but she's out for blood in  the batman missing her chance for  revenge when batman enters the picture  and stops her before she does something  she might regret this isn't the first  time carmine falcone has appeared in a  live action film he was a key part of  batman begins but reeves and crew have  created a terrifying mobster who's  unlike any iteration in the past  check out one of our newest videos right  here plus even more looper videos about  the batman are coming soon subscribe to  our youtube channel and hit the bell so  you don't miss a single one  [Music]
 

